{"4755190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SAMA", "steam_appid": 4755190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family trip deep into the forest turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young girl left completely alone after a mysterious incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/e2300aa71fbc4ceadc8cd5b842a2bce6.poster.avif?t=1779649803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/e2300aa71fbc4ceadc8cd5b842a2bce6.webm?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/e2300aa71fbc4ceadc8cd5b842a2bce6.mp4?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, hungry, and terrified, you must survive in a hostile wilderness filled with disturbing creatures and unknown dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/529f990fb8156b247aab1d4a611dacfe.poster.avif?t=1779649803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/529f990fb8156b247aab1d4a611dacfe.webm?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/529f990fb8156b247aab1d4a611dacfe.mp4?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark forests, abandoned places, and hidden paths while searching for resources, tools, and clues about what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/06995253868c1e4bc22f94492302134c.poster.avif?t=1779649803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/06995253868c1e4bc22f94492302134c.webm?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/06995253868c1e4bc22f94492302134c.mp4?t=1779649803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest is alive.<br>And it is watching you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror focused on atmosphere and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a vulnerable child surviving alone in the wilderness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and dark nighttime exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth, exploration, and resource gathering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying creatures hidden within the forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A family trip deep into the forest turns into a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young girl left completely alone after a mysterious incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755190/extras/e2300aa71fbc4ceadc8cd5b842a2bce6.poster.avif?t=1779649803\" width=1170 height=658 ><source s